## 7. Review checklist (for whoever approves the PR)

- [ ] Every checklist item in Section 3 that applies to this PR is implemented, not stubbed
- [ ] No import from `agentspark-core`/`tools`/`workspace`/`server` into any Codemind-specific module
- [ ] No import from any Agent Spark module into Codemind code, except inside `agentspark/integrations/codemind/`
- [ ] No new external dependency beyond Section 1.2's allowance
- [ ] All config sourced from `.env` — `grep`-check for hardcoded URLs/keys
- [ ] Every public class has a docstring citing the OpenHands source file it ports
- [ ] Test coverage present for every new public class
- [ ] No `agentspark-core` version drift from `agentspark-tools`
